Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeUrbanDrivingWithSlowVehicle" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow vehicle driving slowly in the lane ahead" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:billboard1 a :Billboard ;
    :description "Billboard on the right side of the road" .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Potential lane intrusion due to slow-moving vehicle in front" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to nighttime conditions and potential fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of rear-end collision due to sudden braking of the vehicle in front" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.55"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.70"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Potential lane intrusion due to slow-moving vehicle in front
Severity Score: 0.65

**Risk 2:**
